Derived work
------------
The voice feature (the voice/ package: microphone capture and WAV writing, audio windowing, the ASR worker
subprocess, forced-alignment mapping, the rolling transcript correction logic and prompt, the speaker-marking
service, the remote-microphone streaming protocol and browser capture script, the replay of the recording, and the
source-tag editing logic of record_edit_tags.py) is derived from voice_to_text
(https://github.com/TCM-Dr-Hsieh/voice_to_text) and from TCM-Meridian-mini, both Copyright 2026 Hong-Wen Hsieh and
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (adapted and changed for this project).

